    "\n",
    "Boruta is the most permissive method: it keeps 12 features out of 17, every feature that does better than shuffled noise. It rejects `bedrooms`, `floors`, `sqm_basement`, `yr_renovated` and `condition`. No feature is left undecided (no tentative one)."
