   "source": [
    "### 4. Forward feature selection\n",
    "\n",
    "This method is the most compact: it stops when a new feature improves the R2 by less than 0.001, and keeps 7 features. It avoids redundancy, because a feature that brings the same information as one already chosen is not added."
   ]
  },
