   "source": [
    "### Final choice\n",
    "\n",
    "We keep the features chosen by **at least 3 methods out of 4**, and we add `long`:\n",
    "- `long` has only 2 votes (Boruta and forward selection), but a position needs both coordinates. `lat` alone gives the north-south axis only.\n",
    "- The features dropped are either redundant (`sqm_above` is almost the same as `sqm_living`, correlation of 0.88), or their information is already in a kept feature (`bathrooms` and `sqm_living15` with `sqm_living` and `grade`), or they bring almost nothing (`condition`, `floors`, `yr_renovated`, `bedrooms`).\n",
    "\n",
    "We check this choice below: a good selection must keep the score of the model, with fewer features."
